    <title>Thermal Conductivity in Disordered
  Low-Dimensional Systems</title>
    <summary>  We revisit transport in disordered chains and show that the
conductivity follows a scaling law across three decades. The
analysis uses a transfer-matrix method, and we compare against
prior numerical work.
